sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as llm-d-inference-gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant Route as HTTPRoute<br/>Header Matching
    participant EPP as Router EPP<br/>Endpoint Picker Plugin
    participant Envoy as Envoy Sidecar<br/>Proxy
    participant Prefill as Prefill Deployment<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/gRPC
    participant Decode as Decode Deployment<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/gRPC
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>localhost:4317

    Note over Client,Decode: Inference Request Flow (Disaggregated)

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/completions<br/>Header: X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name: {model}
    GW->>Route: Match HTTPRoute by model header
    Route->>EPP: Route to InferencePool backend
    EPP->>EPP: Select optimal endpoint<br/>(plugin-based routing)

    EPP-->>OTel: Export trace span<br/>(parentbased_traceidratio 10%)

    alt Prefill-Decode Disaggregated Path
        EPP->>Envoy: Forward to prefill endpoint
        Envoy->>Prefill: Inference request<br/>HTTP/gRPC port 8000
        Prefill->>Prefill: Process prompt (prefill phase)
        Prefill->>Decode: NIXL KV-cache transfer<br/>TCP/5600
        Decode->>Decode: Generate tokens (decode phase)
        Decode-->>Envoy: Inference response
        Envoy-->>EPP: Response
    else Direct Decode Path (Single-Host)
        EPP->>Envoy: Forward to decode endpoint
        Envoy->>Decode: Inference request<br/>HTTP/gRPC port 8000
        Decode->>Decode: Full inference (prefill + decode)
        Decode-->>Envoy: Inference response
        Envoy-->>EPP: Response
    end

    EPP-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Decode: Health Check Flow

    Client->>GW: GET /health
    GW->>Decode: Health probe
    Decode-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>Client: Healthy

    Note over Client,Decode: Model Discovery Flow

    Client->>GW: GET /v1/models
    GW->>Decode: Model list probe
    Decode-->>GW: Model list
    GW-->>Client: Available models
